[{"id":3366883043,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Iro7j","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nHowever, I'd make the existing arguments print an error when run, so that it doesn't fail silently like it currently does:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ path/to/template --path ~/d/3d/truck_town/\r\nError: Couldn't load project data at path \".\". Is the .pck file missing?\r\nIf you've renamed the executable, the associated .pck file should also be renamed to match the executable's name (without the extension).\r\n```\r\n\r\nSee an example of this here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9cd297b6f2a0ee660b8f1a6b385582cccf3a9d10/main/main.cpp#L932-L934\r\n\r\nAlso, note that if you `cd` to a project folder (not a PCK), you can still run it directly with an export template binary:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ ~/d/3d/platformer: ~/g/bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64\r\n```\r\n\r\nTherefore, I'm not sure the CWD handling is working correctly.\r\n\r\n(Moving or symlinking the binary to the project folder and running it there will keep working, but I think that part is to be expected.)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909#pullrequestreview-3366883043","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111909","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-22T17:57:11Z"},{"id":3364501909,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7IijmV","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909#pullrequestreview-3364501909","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111909","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-27T10:12:29Z"},{"id":3384528837,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Ju8_F","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","login":"dsnopek","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909#pullrequestreview-3384528837","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111909","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-10-27T16:55:00Z"},{"id":3423480963,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7MDiyD","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"29da94290f0624be804f95373ea06ccb3e4e104b","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"CWD handling seems to be working now, and a message is printed when using `--path` in an unsupported binary. I agree with the removal of `--upwards` as an exposed option, I haven't seen anyone rely on it recently.\r\n\r\nCode looks good to me (same for the CLI help changes).","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909#pullrequestreview-3423480963","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111909","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-05T17:29:27Z"},{"id":3436725612,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7M2EVs","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"29da94290f0624be804f95373ea06ccb3e4e104b","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"The feature sounds good to me. If I understand it correctly, this would require users to start editing the `overrides.cfg` to inject mods? If yet, that would be a good indicator of improved security, while still keeping mods pretty accessible.\r\n\r\nI've also reviewed the code. I'm only a bit familiar with the main interfaces, but from what I can judge this looks fairly straight-forward. Looks good to me anyway.\r\n\r\nWhen we merge this, we should definitely document the compile options (compile and project settings), so people can make an active choice about whether to support mods.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909#pullrequestreview-3436725612","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/r